Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Interpret original NSI data: location sets, M49,
 dissolved

Parse the unmodified nsi.json (location sets incl. M49 regions and
ISO 3166-2 subdivisions) and optionally dissolved.json, so that the
app does not need to convert the name suggestion index data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
